Package: secfilings
Title: Retrieve and Parse SEC EDGAR Filings
Version: 1.0.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Joseph", "Bennett", , "jbennett@jbennettconsulting.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Looks up company identifiers, filing histories and filing
    documents from the SEC EDGAR system, with a local cache to limit requests.
    Extracts the documents bundled in a filing, including XBRL instance files
    and uuencoded attachements, and parses Form 4 insider transactions and
    Schedule 13G beneifical ownership reports.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: 
    httr,
    readr,
    dplyr,
    xml2,
    stringr,
    tibble,
    utils,
    tools
Suggests:
    testthat,
    jsonlite,
    withr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
